        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joel H. Cohen, Robert Cohen, Chuck Sheetz\n- TV Shows: The Simpsons, The Wonder Years, The Ben Stiller Show, The Big Bang Theory\n- Episodes: Flaming Moe's, Wedding for Disaster\n- Places: Calgary, Alberta\n- Roles: writer, director\n\nFacts:\n- Robert Cohen was raised in Calgary, Alberta.\n- Robert Cohen wrote for The Simpsons, The Wonder Years, The Ben Stiller Show, The Big Bang Theory, and many other shows.\n- Robert Cohen wrote the The Simpsons season three episode \"Flaming Moe's.\"\n- Joel H. Cohen is the younger brother of Robert Cohen.\n- Joel H. Cohen wrote the episode \"Wedding for Disaster.\"\n- Chuck Sheetz directed the episode \"Wedding for Disaster.\"",
